  "ingredients": [
    "5 pounds prime rib roast",
    "1 tablespoon kosher salt",
    "2 tablespoons very soft unsalted butter",
    "1 tablespoon kosher salt",
    "2 teaspoons freshly ground black pepper",
    "0.125 teaspoon cayenne pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MqlhIMxSY5AcWaCaZ3kz79RDUAI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8520971-low-and-slow-prime-rib-VAT-4x3-step-01-1-cbddf3b1844541a29aa6f7732c57b8ef.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8520971/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place beef on a pan, and rub with salt. Place meat on a rack or twisted foil so air can circulate under roast, and transfer to the fridge for 24 to 48 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xSdBrkMocrGoYDoUnULyGakmsh4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8520971-low-and-slow-prime-rib-VAT-4x3-step-02-2-10047f5634aa4286bd3f0f89f0e19f0c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8520971/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the refrigerator and let it rest for a few hours to come to room temperature (optional).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4vW2r44FJ9lmJauKJBffmNERro8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8520971-low-and-slow-prime-rib-VAT-4x3-step-02-3-36520034f9b44b73b0c1e48f2feb7ca9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8520971/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C). Transfer roast into a roasting pan, preferably on a rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UX0zO07DaYhUcAHxATYEvxBuBD0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8520971-low-and-slow-prime-rib-VAT-4x3-step-03-6ff0575a0e574d198cdea157bb163630.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8520971/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix butter with coarse salt, pepper, and cayenne in a small bowl and spread onto the sides and top of the roast. Then add more salt to the top. Pour water into the bottom of the pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xChd9XSggZ69pNSzagGkD4YWJLo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8520971-low-and-slow-prime-rib-VAT-4x3-step-04-b2ab9c73bca648eab810b43c482cb2c9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8520971/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast in the preheated oven until internal temperature is 115 to 120 degrees F (46 to 48 degrees C), about 1 hour and 20 minutes (about 20 minutes per pound). Remove from the oven, cover with foil and let rest for at least 20 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NUAc21RkF3rXFsbP0BTFw6IyeMg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8520971-low-and-slow-prime-rib-VAT-4x3-step-05-6ebd2215e2924f93bd60210397e97227.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8520971/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drippings from the pan can be deglazed with broth or water, and served alongside meat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jpDpDfKqLCRtfePao2GM_wJ0f2g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-8520971-low-and-slow-prime-rib-VAT-4x3-3-6b92caba02df4860a1dfd9b2c4058c4c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8520971/step_07.webp"
    }
